## Workflow contract

- This project is a `slides-animejs` presentation. The canonical plan is `presentation_plan.md`.
- Phases: bootstrap → intake → content brainstorm → content Q&A → design brainstorm → visuals → static draft → draft feedback → animation build → QA → handoff.
- Never run the final animation build (phase 8) without explicit user go-ahead.
- Always update `presentation_plan.md` when content or design tokens change.
- Visuals live in `./visuals/`. Auto-extracted media: `./visuals/from-pptx/`. Memes: `./visuals/memes/`.
- Memes only when content tone permits, ~1 per 6 slides max, never in academic decks unless the user opts in.
- Output bundle is `./presentation/`. Reset by re-running `scripts/build.py` — it is idempotent.
- `CLAUDE.md` is a mirror of this file. Keep them in sync; rewrite both atomically on phase transitions.

